{"ts": 0.148062, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97m4.4 — globs\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[36mGlobs\u001b[0m match many filenames at once. The shell expands them\r\n\u001b[36mbefore\u001b[0m the command sees them.\r\n\r\n  \u001b[92mls *.txt\u001b[0m              \u001b[90m# every .txt file in this folder\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mwc -l *.txt\u001b[0m           \u001b[90m# count lines in each .txt file\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mcat *.txt\u001b[0m             \u001b[90m# print them all back-to-back\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[91mPredict before you act.\u001b[0m  \u001b[92mrm *\u001b[0m removes everything\r\nin the current folder. \u001b[92mrm *.tmp\u001b[0m removes only .tmp files.\r\n\r\n\u001b[93m▶ Type \u001b[92mnext\u001b[93m to take Stage 4's gate.\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 560}
{"ts": 0.148484, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 251}
{"ts": 0.164621, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[95mnext\u001b[0m\u001b[90m ▸ go on\u001b[0m   \u001b[95mshow\u001b[0m\u001b[90m ▸ this screen again\u001b[0m   \u001b[95mprev\u001b[0m\u001b[90m ▸ back\u001b[0m   \u001b[95mquit\u001b[0m\u001b[90m ▸ save and leave\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 159}
