{"ts": 0.173257, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97mSTAGE 4 — GATE\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[36mRecall\u001b[0m (three questions, all three must be correct).\r\nThen a \u001b[36mpractical task\u001b[0m.\r\n", "len": 127}
{"ts": 0.17365, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 251}
{"ts": 0.173716, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m \u001b[96mQ1: What does \u001b[92mcommand -v vim\u001b[0m print, if Vim is installed?\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 89}
{"ts": 0.173744, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "the path to vim\n", "len": 16}
{"ts": 0.173764, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m \u001b[92manswer in words:\u001b[0m the path to vim\r\n", "len": 56}
{"ts": 0.182319, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "  \u001b[92m✓\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 18}
{"ts": 0.182382, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m \u001b[96mQ2: What is the difference between \u001b[92m>\u001b[0m and \u001b[92m>>\u001b[0m?\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 86}
{"ts": 0.182414, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "> overwrites, >> appends\n", "len": 25}
{"ts": 0.182435, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m \u001b[92manswer in words:\u001b[0m > overwrites, >> appends\r\n", "len": 65}
{"ts": 0.191449, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "  \u001b[92m✓\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 18}
{"ts": 0.191531, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m \u001b[96mQ3: Why does \u001b[92mvim my notes.txt\u001b[0m open two files instead of one?\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m \u001b[92manswer in words:\u001b[0m ", "len": 132}
{"ts": 0.191586, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "because of the space\n", "len": 21}
